2010 Rust Rewrite Mashup is a fork of IW4L by chasmlol that adds Skate 3's
skating and a Minecraft world to it.
https://github.com/chasmlol/2010-rust-rewrite-mashup

This branch carries only the fork's standalone Minecraft game.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Third-party source code
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

No third-party source code is vendored in this repository. The game's own
dependencies are the crates declared in its Cargo.toml files, under their own
licences.

third_party/minecraftoss/ — five crates of MinecraftOSS, a Rust Minecraft
  engine, copied from its commit 4013a68 (see its README). Its few data
  tables are gameplay values measured from Minecraft (food, waxing and
  dispenser rules). No Minecraft code, JARs, textures or sounds are included:
  the game downloads Minecraft's files from Mojang on first run.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
